// Arduino Wokwi Simulation (v0.2.0)
// Triggers: arduino/wokwi/uno/单片机 keywords, .ino/wokwi.toml/diagram.json files, @wokwi

## Workflow

1. Generate .ino code, read core/uno/components.md, create diagram.json + wokwi.toml
2. Run ./core/scripts/compile.sh <dir>
3. Tell user: F1 → "Wokwi: Start Simulation"
4. Ask user: "Does the simulation work?" If no, fix and recompile
5. Run arduino-cli board list:
   - No board → ask user to connect
   - One board → auto-select
   - Multiple → show list for user to pick
6. Run arduino-cli upload -p <PORT> --fqbn <FQBN> <dir>
7. Board LED blinks 3x. Ask: "Open Serial Monitor?"

## Component Reference

Read core/uno/components.md for pin names, attributes, routing waypoints.
